## What is still missing, exactly

Unchanged and still first in line: an **unconditional prime-side bound for
`‖G‖_F²`** (main term plus error) for the actual zeros of `ζ`, which would
supply the budget `E(T)` of §3.  The remaining hypotheses of the localization
statements are: the window/tail condition, the plateau/taper conditions, and now
— in place of the ordinate separation `δ`, which §2 eliminates — the unit-window
count `N`.  No statement in this tree implies the Riemann Hypothesis.
